# Windscribe preset.
#
# Config source: windscribe.com -> My Account -> Config Generators -> WireGuard.
#
# Quirks that matter here:
#   * In-tunnel resolver is 10.255.255.1.
#   * Windscribe rotates the peer Endpoint more often than most providers. If a
#     namespace tunnel that used to work goes quiet, re-download the config
#     before debugging anything else.
#   * The generator can emit configs with a very long AllowedIPs list rather
#     than 0.0.0.0/0. Keep the default-route form for the torrent namespace, or
#     traffic to unlisted ranges is simply dropped with no route.

PROFILE_PREFIX="windscribe"
FALLBACK_DNS="10.255.255.1"

SERVER_TAG_REGEX=''

LINK_DNS_OVER_TLS="no"
